control 6 0
put In 22 49
test eq qincoming 36113 0
test eq get T 2 36112
control 4 2
test eq qincoming 36110 0
test eq get T 6 0
qcancel
put Q 1 4294967295
jobinput
test not qsubmit 36114
test eq get Q 1 4294967295
test not qstart 0 36114
test eq get Q 0 42
test qstart 43 0
put Inlen 0 4097
test not qsubmit 0
test eq get Q 1 0
put Inlen 0 0
test not qsubmit 0
test not qsent 0 true
note Maximum payload crosses all five datagrams, preserving every byte except CR/LF.
put Inlen 0 4096
for i ulong 4096
put In i uchar rem i 251
end
test qsubmit 0
test qnext 0 true
test eq get T 10 5
test qsent 0 true
for k ulong 5
test qnext 0 true
test eq get T 10 1
tcopy
test pkparse
test eq get N 1 1
test eq get N 2 add k 1
test eq get N 3 5
test eq get N 4 4096
size = ulong 1000
if eq k 4
size = ulong 96
end
test eq get N 6 size
bad = ulong 0
for j ulong size
want = uchar rem add mul k 1000 j 251
if or eq want 10 eq want 13
want = uchar 32
end
if ne get In add get N 5 j want
bad = add bad 1
end
end
test eq bad 0
test qsent 0 true
end
note A first LINE also stops job retries without a preceding ACK.
linepkt 1
test eq qincoming 1 1
test eq get T 6 1
test qnext 1 true
test eq get T 10 3
test qsent 1 true
control 6 0
test eq qincoming 2 1
test not qnext 2000 true
note Fill the eight-line queue; no GOT until a ninth line can actually be kept.
for k ulong 7
linepkt add k 2
test eq qincoming add k 2003 1
test qnext add k 2003 true
test eq get T 10 3
test qsent add k 2003 true
end
linepkt 9
test eq qincoming 2010 0
test eq get Q 2 8
test eq get T 13 0
test qtake
linepkt 9
test eq qincoming 2011 1
test eq get Q 2 9
test qnext 2011 true
test not qsent 2010 true
test eq get T 10 3
test qsent 2011 true
note Malformed ACK and wrong kinds cannot advance the accepted clock.
put Inlen 0 0
b = packet 4 1 1 0 0
tcopy
test eq qincoming 2012 0
test eq get T 0 2011
control 5 0
test eq qincoming 2012 0
test eq get T 0 2011
qcancel
control 4 1
test eq qincoming 2013 0
test eq get Q 4 0
ret int get Fails 0
end
